    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nApartment 8, Woodlawn House, Woodlawn Park, Dún Laoghaire is a bright and spacious two-bedroom, first-floor apartment situated in a well-established and sought-after residential development. The property offers comfortable and well-proportioned accommodation, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors.\n\nThe apartment benefits from a welcoming sense of space and natural light throughout, with two well-sized bedrooms and generous living accommodation with a south facing balcony. Its first-floor position provides a pleasant residential setting, while the property is ideally located within easy reach of the many amenities Dún Laoghaire has to offer.\n\nWoodlawn Park enjoys a convenient location close to shops, cafés, restaurants and excellent transport links, while the beautiful coastline, harbour and seafront are also nearby. With its combination of bright, spacious accommodation, convenient location and dedicated parking, Apartment 8 represents an excellent opportunity to enjoy all that Dún Laoghaire has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Special Features</li><li> Two-bedroom first-floor apartment c.79sqm</li><li> Bright and spacious accommodation</li><li> Sunny South facing Balcony</li><li> One designated parking space</li><li> Sought-after development</li><li> Convenient Dún Laoghaire location</li><li> Close to the coast and Dún Laoghaire Harbour</li><li> Excellent local amenities and transport links</li><li> Self-managed owners' management company</li><li> Management fee: 2,000 per annum</li><li> Ideal for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors</ul>"
      },
